cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite the archived dataset."
type: dataset
title: "Jinteng 金縢: A Character-Level Alignment Dataset of the Received Shangshu and Tsinghua Manuscript"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-01"
authors:
  - family-names: Baley
    given-names: Julien
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1056-6211"
    affiliation:
      - "School of Languages, Cultures, and Linguistics, SOAS University of London, UK"
abstract: >-
  A character-level alignment of the received Jinteng in the Shangshu with the
  Tsinghua University manuscript, including IDS transcriptions, graph
  alignments, source and image mappings, reviewed manuscript crops, JSON
  Schemas, and a static viewer. Project-authored material is CC BY 4.0;
  manuscript images are distributed under separate permissions documented in
  witness-images/RIGHTS.md.
